+        // blends a field's rows for a TV is left out - with the frame before (a buffer on the
+        // screen now), or with the rows of the other field (its own buffer). Transformers draws
+        // its last frame's picture over the odd rows at half weight, after the glow and the HUD
+        // (a trail behind moving things on every other picture), and then each even row over
