+    // ---- The native pixel path (PS2X_GPU_NATIVE; docs/RENDERER.md, stage 3) ----
+    //
+    // A batch drawn with the GPU's own depth test and blending instead of the interlock. Its
+    // colour goes through an RGBA8 view of the buffer's own R32UI texture - the same bytes, R
+    // the low one, as the GS's CT32 word - so what the native batches draw is the buffer as
