+    // of the depth buffer's own (kNativeUnpack and kNativePack copy it from and to the R32UI one).
+    // The colour is made as kDrawFragmentMain makes it; the blend (A - B) * C + D is a sum of
+    // the source and the destination, each with a factor, and with C known here the GPU's blend
