+ * @param secretSize The length of @p secret, in bytes.
+ *
+ * @pre
+ *   @p statePtr must not be `NULL`.
+ *
+ * @return @ref XXH_OK on success.
+ * @return @ref XXH_ERROR on failure.
+ *
+ * `secret` is referenced, it _must outlive_ the hash streaming session.
